      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but what's the point? even if i go to therapy, the \"me\" that would be sitting in that chair is already gone. it’s like trying to fix a house that’s already been leveled. honestly, it feels cleaner to just not be around for the rest of this erasure. it would be easier to just stop existing than to keep watching a ghost go through the motions.",
